<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V NORTHERN TERRITORY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V NORTHERN TERRITORY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ALICE SPRINGS, Australia 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in a</p>
<p>limited overs tour match between West Indies and a Northern</p>
<p>Territory Invitation XI on Tuesday.</p>
